红卡杜艾，黄波旁，黄伊卡图）\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          海拔：1200 米\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          采收年份：2020.5-8月\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          处理方式：厌氧日晒 Anaerobic Natural\n          <br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          风味：梨子酒，香蕉，菠萝，麦芽\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Pear cider, Bananam, Pineapple, Malty\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q36MicNiclTfcCUkjP6ZaWC6TuSBFdG4b00oOkHd97wB6V2VlSqkrnIaCSyJ16FV2GkicZCPWzhfT7w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 840px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于 São Silverstre 圣野庄园\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iajpOhGxecWPLaJzcpT9kShINcfbzibwribcV0OPiaQ5zj79AiaAzgicwfxya10ou7nskXJ6MCXHPibzfTvvLJibkyprnw/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align: start;white-space: normal;vertical-align: middle;box-sizing: border-box;width: 784px;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Andrade家族的咖啡历史开始于1901年，至今已经有119年的咖啡种植经验，专注生产高品质的巴西精品咖啡。白草庄园是家族第一个庄园，在米纳斯州，喜拉多产区高地，Carmo do Paranaiba。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在1990年，因为扩大产能，Andrade两兄弟购买了一个新的咖啡庄园——圣野庄园，也是在米纳斯州喜拉多产区，这里的海拔在1100-1200米，干湿季分明，拥有肥沃的火山土土壤，充足的雨水和日晒，非常适合栽种高品质咖啡。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/iajpOhGxecWPLaJzcpT9kShINcfbzibwrib1AHbAVdFRzeTauJdPT4Nw5HDEX0OSDXPnXYluaZ4IZdicIPxRrHH3BA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align: start;white-space: normal;vertical-align: middle;box-sizing: border-box;width: 784px;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: left;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n          庄园第四代庄园主：弟弟Ismael Andrade（右）与哥哥Eduardo Andrade（左）传承了先辈对咖啡的热情，以及对这片土地深沉的爱，带着对大自然的敬畏之心好好耕作这片土地，生产出更高品质的咖啡。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TYSibVOfDRbicMRo8QHasfia2JzibF9IAJkZArPVRvl2Uy0c2oHicbFfzSKYiaySSKPXbYejibWDvTdxQDg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          图片来自cafeimports 喜拉多是淡黄色区块\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理过程\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/iajpOhGxecWPLaJzcpT9kShINcfbzibwrib3WZ2JKMDkhtPpVVoLJyPsrtImW718unXibZjl8Ug8XDhxRLM66OIj9w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align: start;white-space: normal;vertical-align: middle;box-sizing: border-box;width: 784px;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(214, 214, 214);\">\n          图片来自印格贸易\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n          电子鲜果色选机去筛选成熟与未成熟的果实，相对于传统的水洗分离法，筛选过程中其实不需要使用到水，豆子的表皮也不会损坏，能够更多地保留鲜果的糖分。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/iajpOhGxecWPLaJzcpT9kShINcfbzibwribicaSboBXsDgpj1NvyYI7XszfBJe3cYopgWqSlnXgFYOk8ZKX15ghkIw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align: start;white-space: normal;vertical-align: middle;box-sizing: border-box;width: 784px;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(214, 214, 214);color: rgb(214, 214, 214);font-size: 12px;text-align: center;\">\n           图片来自印格贸易\n          </span>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(214, 214, 214);color: rgb(214, 214, 214);font-size: 12px;text-align: center;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n          严格控制咖啡鲜果层的厚度，环境的温湿度，每30分钟翻一遍咖啡果，保证咖啡豆能均匀地被干燥，保证咖啡的干净度。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/iajpOhGxecWPLaJzcpT9kShINcfbzibwribfHk9YjwMpO1XDtKf7dJvtUyn88Oa1VfNFFibzDic280HbDex5gxG8AYA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align: start;white-space: normal;vertical-align: middle;box-sizing: border-box;width: 784px;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(214, 214, 214);color: rgb(214, 214, 214);font-size: 12px;text-align: center;\">\n            图片来自印格贸易\n           </span>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(214, 214, 214);color: rgb(214, 214, 214);font-size: 12px;text-align: center;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n          6台生豆色选机，3台做粗挑选，3台做细挑选。所有的微批次咖啡，我们都要经过至少6次的色选机，然后随机取样手选瑕疵是否及格，不及格会继续再过色选机。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iajpOhGxecWPLaJzcpT9kShINcfbzibwribhXaHPlicOtaYJKRkeTzFe8HZnYnpRmRoSn8EtzhGMFibMg1tgPbjILlQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align: start;white-space: normal;vertical-align: middle;box-sizing: border-box;width: 784px;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(214, 214, 214);color: rgb(214, 214, 214);font-size: 12px;text-align: center;\">\n             图片来自印格贸易\n            </span>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(214, 214, 214);color: rgb(214, 214, 214);font-size: 12px;text-align: center;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n          Andrade家族拥有自己专业的杯测团队，成员均拥有Q-grader的证书，每一批次生豆必须经过严格的杯测管控后，才能装运出口，正因为这样的认真，Andrade家族的咖啡多年来在国内外的咖啡生豆比赛中屡获殊荣。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆，欢迎关注小程序或者淘宝店铺 “有容乃大”\n          <br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"height: 173px;width: 408px;\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
